WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Besides, is now the time to talk about renting a house?

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Don't you see that I'm about to die?

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,600
The big cherry blossom fruit on my head is weird

4
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:09,400
can't you see

5
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:12,600
I said, it seems like you are a human being

6
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:16,000
You really don't take me seriously?

7
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:19,760
Where did that long-haired beast come from?

8
00:00:19,890 --> 00:00:21,490
Where can I stay cool?

9
00:00:21,490 --> 00:00:23,490
I am busy entertaining Master Ye now.

10
00:00:24,490 --> 00:00:25,890
I'm not in the mood to take care of you

11
00:00:27,490 --> 00:00:29,490
so interesting

12
00:00:31,610 --> 00:00:35,610
A human being who doesn't even have any ghost energy about him

13
00:00:35,610 --> 00:00:37,610
How dare you be so arrogant
